# Nothing is declared here.
#
# The SDK's per-framework header roots (fw_Kernel, fw_System) used to be, from the map
# in //buck/generated:sdk_framework_darwin_Developer.bzl. Their headers live under
# Platforms/.../MacOSX.sdk/usr/include, which is its own package, and a source
# attribute cannot name a file across a package boundary -- so this package did not
# parse AT ALL, and nothing could depend on either root. That is why zprint had no way
# to reach <Kernel/IOKit/IOKitDebug.h>. They are declared where the files are now:
#
#   //src/darwin/Developer/Platforms/MacOSX.platform/Developer/SDKs/MacOSX.sdk/usr/include:fw_Kernel
#
# This file stays so the directory keeps a package of its own rather than folding into
# //darwin, whose globs would then walk the whole SDK tree.
